<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/msa@/~cl_3__list_1__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memotong takrif \"menjalankan perniagaan\";"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/msa@/~cl_3__list_1__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/msa@/~cl_3__list_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/msa@> .
